# Test bed for dynamic pages (tasks S11-T01), the record where the rules hide controls:
# iaIsActive is false (dates hidden) and the contact is empty (comment and order grid hidden).
#
# The page file says these controls exist, so validation passes and every line below fails at
# run time with "not found". That gap - a page file is a snapshot of one record's state - is what
# S11 is about. Until it is closed this case is expected to FAIL.

use Supervisor
open iaTestsForm for 6993bace-71b6-4be7-84b8-cf363d0113be

click GeneralInfoTab

check-value iaContactLookup eq ""
check iaComment exists
check iaOrderList exists
check iaDate exists
end
